What Are Electronic Article Surveillance Labels?
Electronic Article Surveillance Labels (EAS) are sophisticated anti-theft devices that form the detection component of EAS systems. These labels contain specialized security elements - whether RF, AM, or RFID-based - that trigger alarms when passing through detection gates at store exits. Modern EAS labels have evolved beyond basic security functions to incorporate inventory management capabilities, making them dual-purpose solutions for retailers.
